# Production Environment Variables for Vercel Deployment
# Set these in Vercel Project Settings > Environment Variables

# API Base URL - Your deployed FastAPI backend URL
# Example: https://taskguard-api.onrender.com
# Example: https://api.taskguard.yourdomain.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend-url.com

# Note: Do NOT include trailing slash
# The backend must be deployed separately (not on Vercel)
# Recommended hosting: Render, Railway, Fly.io, or a VPS with Docker